traits.smithy.api#documentation:
 You can use a simplified version:
```json
{
    "properties": [
        {
            "key": "email",
            "value": "x@y.com",
            "operator": "exact",
            "type": "event"
        }
    ]
}
```

Or you can create more complicated queries with AND and OR:
```json
{
    "properties": {
        "type": "AND",
        "values": [
            {
                "type": "OR",
                "values": [
                    {"key": "email", ...},
                    {"key": "email", ...}
                ]
            },
            {
                "type": "AND",
                "values": [
                    {"key": "email", ...},
                    {"key": "email", ...}
                ]
            }
        ]
    ]
}
```


* `AND` - AND
* `OR` - OR
